{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "extraction.schema.json",
  "title": "Step 4 Extract 输出 · ExtractionResult（契约即规则）",
  "description": "★ 零规则架构：LLM 全权负责语义（按约定格式交卷），ID/span/literal/去重等确定性锚点惰性化到消费层。宿主交卷五件套：entities + relations + attributes + rules（业务规则 v3）+ processes（业务流程 v4）。mention_id / relation_id / triplet_id / rule_id / process_id / step_id / flow_id 由 Python 用 sha256 内容寻址补算——原版用 hash() 带随机盐导致跨进程 ID 漂移、图谱无限膨胀。char_start=-1 表示尽力定位失败（未定位），允许；object_literal 由 object_type 派生（DATE/MONEY/PERCENT/QUANTITY → true）；value_type 是属性值类型（独立枚举），仅属性三元组非空；modality 是规则模态（独立枚举），仅规则非空；kind 是流程步骤类型（独立枚举，TASK/GATEWAY/EVENT），flow.type 是控制流类型（独立枚举，SEQUENCE/PARALLEL/CONDITIONAL/LOOP），flows 的 from/to 是整数下标引用 steps。规则与流程均不进入实体-边图谱，作为独立产出保留（build_kg 在 metadata 登记 rule_count / process_count）。",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "doc_id",
    "mentions",
    "relations",
    "triplets"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "doc_id": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "processes": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "业务流程（v4 新增）：有序活动 + 控制流。本体论依据：流程是 DOLCE 的 perdurant（持续体，在时间中延展），区别于实体（endurant）与属性（DatatypeProperty）。process_id 由 name 内容寻址；step_id 由 (process, index, label) 内容寻址；flow_id 由 (process, from, to, type, condition) 内容寻址——Python 补算。flows 的 from/to 是 steps 数组整数下标，越界丢弃。流程不进入实体-边图谱，作为独立产出保留（build_kg 在 metadata 登记 process_count）。",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "process_id",
          "doc_id",
          "name",
          "steps"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "process_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Python 补算：stable_id(\"process\", name)"
          },
          "doc_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "流程名（LLM 给，内容寻址）"
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "流程说明（可空）"
          },
          "steps": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "按执行顺序的步骤列表；index 即数组下标",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "step_id",
                "process_id",
                "index",
                "label",
                "kind"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "step_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Python 补算：stable_id(\"step\", process_id, index, label)"
                },
                "process_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "index": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0,
                  "description": "steps 数组下标（0-based），flows 用其引用"
                },
                "label": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "步骤内容（做什么）"
                },
                "kind": {
                  "enum": [
                    "TASK",
                    "GATEWAY",
                    "EVENT",
                    "START",
                    "END",
                    "SYSTEM_TASK"
                  ],
                  "description": "步骤类型独立 3 类枚举：TASK 活动/GATEWAY 决策点/EVENT 事件；判不出用 TASK"
                },
                "actor": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "执行者（用实体的 canonical），可空"
                },
                "evidence_span": {
                  "type": [
                    "array",
                    "null"
                  ],
                  "description": "evidence 在原文中的 [start, end]，尽力定位，找不到为 null",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  "minItems": 2,
                  "maxItems": 2
                },
                "evidence_text": {
                  "type": [
                    "string",
                    "null"
                  ],
                  "description": "LLM 提供的原文短引用（溯源用）"
                },
                "extractor": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "default": "llm.proc.v1"
                },
                "confidence": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "minimum": 0.0,
                  "maximum": 1.0,
                  "default": 1.0
                },
                "provenance": {
                  "type": [
                    "object",
                    "null"
                  ]
                },
                "metadata": {
                  "type": "object"
                },
                "sub_process_ref": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "flows": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "控制流：from/to 引用 steps 数组下标，越界由薄壳丢弃",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "flow_id",
                "process_id",
                "from_index",
                "to_index",
                "type"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "flow_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Python 补算：stable_id(\"flow\", process_id, from, to, type, condition)"
                },
                "process_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "from_index": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0,
                  "description": "来源步骤下标"
                },
                "to_index": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0,
                  "description": "目标步骤下标"
                },
                "type": {
                  "enum": [
                    "SEQUENCE",
                    "PARALLEL",
                    "CONDITIONAL",
                    "LOOP"
                  ],
                  "description": "控制流类型独立 4 类枚举：SEQUENCE 顺序/PARALLEL 并行(AND)/CONDITIONAL 排他分支(XOR)/LOOP 循环；判不出用 SEQUENCE"
                },
                "condition": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "仅 CONDITIONAL 分支携带的分支条件（可空）"
                },
                "evidence_span": {
                  "type": [
                    "array",
                    "null"
                  ],
                  "description": "evidence 在原文中的 [start, end]，尽力定位，找不到为 null",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  "minItems": 2,
                  "maxItems": 2
                },
                "evidence_text": {
                  "type": [
                    "string",
                    "null"
                  ],
                  "description": "LLM 提供的原文短引用（溯源用）"
                },
                "extractor": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "default": "llm.proc.v1"
                },
                "confidence": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "minimum": 0.0,
                  "maximum": 1.0,
                  "default": 1.0
                },
                "provenance": {
                  "type": [
                    "object",
                    "null"
                  ]
                },
                "metadata": {
                  "type": "object"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "extractor": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "llm.proc.v1"
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0.0,
            "maximum": 1.0,
            "default": 1.0
          },
          "provenance": {
            "type": [
              "object",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "metadata": {
            "type": "object"
          },
          "preconditions": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "postconditions": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "states": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "状态机（v6 新增）：对象生命周期状态迁移，预测引擎的骨架。sm_id 由 (object, name) 内容寻址；state_id 由 (sm_id, 下标, label) 内容寻址；transition_id 由 (sm_id, from, to, event, condition) 内容寻址——Python 补算。transitions 的 from/to 是 states 数组整数下标，越界丢弃。状态机不进入实体-边图谱（build_kg 在 metadata 登记 state_count）。",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "sm_id",
          "doc_id",
          "object",
          "name",
          "states"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "sm_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Python 补算：stable_id(\"sm\", object, name)"
          },
          "doc_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "object": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "状态机归属对象（用实体 canonical）"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "状态机名（LLM 给，内容寻址）"
          },
          "states": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "状态列表；index 即数组下标",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "state_id",
                "sm_id",
                "index",
                "label"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "state_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Python 补算：stable_id(\"state\", sm_id, index, label)"
                },
                "sm_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "index": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0
                },
                "label": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "状态名（做什么/处于什么）"
                },
                "initial": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "default": false,
                  "description": "是否初始状态（可空）"
                },
                "evidence_span": {
                  "type": [
                    "array",
                    "null"
                  ],
                  "items": {
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  "minItems": 2,
                  "maxItems": 2
                },
                "evidence_text": {
                  "type": [
                    "string",
                    "null"
                  ]
                },
                "extractor": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "default": "llm.sm.v1"
                },
                "confidence": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "minimum": 0.0,
                  "maximum": 1.0,
                  "default": 1.0
                },
                "provenance": {
                  "type": [
                    "object",
                    "null"
                  ]
                },
                "metadata": {
                  "type": "object"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "transitions": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "状态迁移：from/to 引用 states 数组下标，越界由薄壳丢弃",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "transition_id",
                "sm_id",
                "from_index",
                "to_index"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "transition_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Python 补算：stable_id(\"trans\", sm_id, from, to, event, condition)"
                },
                "sm_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "from_index": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0
                },
                "to_index": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0
                },
                "event": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "触发事件（可空）"
                },
                "condition": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "守卫条件（可空）"
                },
                "action": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "迁移动作（可空）"
                },
                "evidence_span": {
                  "type": [
                    "array",
                    "null"
                  ],
                  "items": {
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  "minItems": 2,
                  "maxItems": 2
                },
                "evidence_text": {
                  "type": [
                    "string",
                    "null"
                  ]
                },
                "extractor": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "default": "llm.sm.v1"
                },
                "confidence": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "minimum": 0.0,
                  "maximum": 1.0,
                  "default": 1.0
                },
                "provenance": {
                  "type": [
                    "object",
                    "null"
                  ]
                },
                "metadata": {
                  "type": "object"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "extractor": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "llm.sm.v1"
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0.0,
            "maximum": 1.0,
            "default": 1.0
          },
          "provenance": {
            "type": [
              "object",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "metadata": {
            "type": "object"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "functions": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "函数指标（v6 新增）：把业务经验写成可计算定义，是推演的输入。function_id 由 (name, subject, formula) 内容寻址——Python 补算。不进入实体-边图谱（build_kg 在 metadata 登记 function_count）。",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "function_id",
          "doc_id",
          "name",
          "formula"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "function_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Python 补算：stable_id(\"func\", name, subject, formula)"
          },
          "doc_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "指标名"
          },
          "subject": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "作用主体（用实体 canonical），可空"
          },
          "formula": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "计算定义（自然语言/运算符描述，不必可执行）"
          },
          "inputs": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "依赖因子（实体 canonical 或字面量名），可空"
          },
          "output_type": {
            "enum": [
              "NUMBER",
              "PERCENT",
              "RANK",
              "BOOLEAN",
              "ENUM",
              "STRING",
              "OTHER"
            ],
            "description": "输出类型独立 7 类枚举；判不出用 OTHER"
          },
          "evidence_span": {
            "type": [
              "array",
              "null"
            ],
            "items": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "minItems": 2,
            "maxItems": 2
          },
          "evidence_text": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "extractor": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "llm.fn.v1"
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0.0,
            "maximum": 1.0,
            "default": 1.0
          },
          "provenance": {
            "type": [
              "object",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "metadata": {
            "type": "object"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "temporal": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "时序时态（v6 新增）：把时间限定绑定到某事实/规则/流程/状态。temporal_id 由 (subject, kind, value) 内容寻址——Python 补算。不进入实体-边图谱（build_kg 在 metadata 登记 temporal_count）。",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "temporal_id",
          "doc_id",
          "subject",
          "kind",
          "value"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "temporal_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Python 补算：stable_id(\"temporal\", subject, kind, value)"
          },
          "doc_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "subject": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "主体：事实/规则/流程名或实体 canonical"
          },
          "kind": {
            "enum": [
              "VALIDITY",
              "FREQUENCY",
              "WINDOW",
              "TRIGGER"
            ],
            "description": "时态类型独立 4 类枚举：生效/有效期→VALIDITY，频率/周期→FREQUENCY，时间窗/预测窗口→WINDOW，触发时点→TRIGGER；判不出用 VALIDITY"
          },
          "value": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "时间描述（逐字取自原文）"
          },
          "anchor": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "时间锚点（可空）"
          },
          "evidence_span": {
            "type": [
              "array",
              "null"
            ],
            "items": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "minItems": 2,
            "maxItems": 2
          },
          "evidence_text": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "extractor": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "llm.tp.v1"
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0.0,
            "maximum": 1.0,
            "default": 1.0
          },
          "provenance": {
            "type": [
              "object",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "metadata": {
            "type": "object"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "actions": {
